GameTranslateToolkitCJK Unity 2022 font asset notices
===================================================

This package contains a renamed TextMeshPro font asset built by sorrowmoil
from the Yozai font by LXGW and Y.OzVox. The font software remains under the
SIL Open Font License 1.1 reproduced in full below. The TMP asset builder's
separate download/use/modification/repackaging permissions follow afterward;
those permissions do not replace or relax the original font license.

Original font: Yozai Regular v0.868 (September 12, 2025)
https://github.com/lxgw/yozai-font/releases/tag/v0.868
Font license, pinned source revision 90a91ca019faad7b7dae885a4f70a44359021333:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lxgw/yozai-font/90a91ca019faad7b7dae885a4f70a44359021333/OFL.txt

Original TMP asset: sorrowmoil MoeFont release Moe / 2022.zip / yozai 2022
https://github.com/sorrowmoil/sorrowmoil-MoeFont-for-XUnity.AutoTranslator/releases/tag/Moe
Asset build/repackaging notice, pinned source revision 35921b06f86588920856a707d969bf00e1089bce:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sorrowmoil/sorrowmoil-MoeFont-for-XUnity.AutoTranslator/35921b06f86588920856a707d969bf00e1089bce/LICENSE.txt

Toolkit changes (2026-10-06): the TMP asset's primary name and FaceInfo family
name, atlas/material names, Unity Font wrapper name and asset-bundle/container
identifiers were changed to GameTranslateToolkitCJK. The bundle was repacked
with LZ4 using UnityPy 1.25.4. Original embedded TTF bytes, glyph data, character
tables, texture pixels and font license metadata were not edited. The name
Yozai is used here solely to acknowledge the original source; it is not the
primary name of the modified TMP asset. The original TTF embedded as a source
font is byte-identical to the original author's release.

Embedded original TTF SHA-256:
25071998a0fe6a72f54c235e714986d259633e5ff670b1a2b5e264387f3316ac
Modified asset bundle SHA-256:
f1af95422720a8cd8f41c49553e0204e8c19b4e92d2b63c471beb4df591b829b

No endorsement by the original font authors or asset builder is implied.
Keep this complete notice with every redistributed copy. Do not sell the font
by itself, remove copyright notices, relicense font software, or reuse reserved
names as primary names of further modified versions.

